#: Views/SmtpSettings.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Email.Smtp.Views.SmtpSettings.Edit"
msgid "The SMTP server domain, e.g. <i>smtp.mailprovider.com</i>."
msgstr "SMTP 服务器域，例如 <i>smtp.mailprovider.com</i>。"

#: Views/SmtpSettings.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Email.Smtp.Views.SmtpSettings.Edit"
msgid "The SMTP server port, usually 25."
msgstr "SMTP 服务器端口，通常为 25。"

#: Views/SmtpSettings.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Email.Smtp.Views.SmtpSettings.Edit"
msgid ""
"The default email address to use as a sender, unless the email sender is "
"set."
msgstr "除非已设置电子邮件发件人，否则默认使用此电子邮件地址作为发件人。"

#: Views/SmtpSettings.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Email.Smtp.Views.SmtpSettings.Edit"
msgid ""
"The delivery method used when sending email. Use Network in production. The "
"other options can be useful when developing and testing."
msgstr "发送电子邮件时使用的传递方法。生产环境请使用“网络”。其他选项可用于开发和测试。"

#: Views/SmtpSettings.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Email.Smtp.Views.SmtpSettings.Edit"
msgid "The encryption method used when connecting to mail server."
msgstr "连接到邮件服务器时使用的加密方法。"

#: Views/SmtpSettings.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Email.Smtp.Views.SmtpSettings.Edit"
msgid "The password for authentication."
msgstr "用于身份验证的密码。"

#: Views/SmtpSettings.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Email.Smtp.Views.SmtpSettings.Edit"
msgid "The proxy port is optional."
msgstr "代理端口为可选项。"

#: Views/SmtpSettings.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Email.Smtp.Views.SmtpSettings.Edit"
msgid "The proxy server is optional."
msgstr "代理服务器为可选项。"

#: Views/SmtpSettings.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Email.Smtp.Views.SmtpSettings.Edit"
msgid "The username for authentication."
msgstr "用于身份验证的用户名。"

#: Views/SmtpSettings.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Email.Smtp.Views.SmtpSettings.Edit"
msgid ""
"Use <code>/</code> for the tenant's default pickup folder or a subfolder "
"such as <code>/Outbound</code>. The configured base path defaults to "
"<code>{{ AppData }}\\Sites\\{{ ShellSettings.Name }}\\Emails</code>, is "
"expanded from configuration only, and mail stays sandboxed under that "
"folder."
msgstr ""
"使用 <code>/</code> 表示租户的默认拾取文件夹，或使用 <code>/Outbound</code> 等子文件夹。配置的基础路径默认为 "
"<code>{{ AppData }}\\Sites\\{{ ShellSettings.Name "
"}}\\Emails</code>，仅通过配置进行展开，并且邮件始终限制在该文件夹内。"

#: Views/SmtpSettings.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Email.Smtp.Views.SmtpSettings.Edit"
msgid "Use Windows authentication"
msgstr "使用 Windows 身份验证"

#: Views/SmtpSettings.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Email.Smtp.Views.SmtpSettings.Edit"
msgid "User name"
msgstr "用户名"

#: Views/SmtpSettings.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Email.Smtp.Views.SmtpSettings.Edit"
msgid ""
"When this option is selected, the application pool or host-process identity "
"is used to authenticate with the mail server."
msgstr "选中此选项后，将使用应用程序池或主机进程的身份向邮件服务器进行身份验证。"
